// Copy to Local.xcconfig (ignored by git) and fill in. It is read last, so it overrides Shared.xcconfig
// and Release.xcconfig.
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = XXXXXXXXXX
// PULLBULL_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID = Iv1.0000000000000000
// PULLBULL_GITHUB_APP_SLUG = your-app-slug
// Sign in with GitHub keeps tokens in the data protection keychain, which needs this entitlement and a
// provisioning profile. Set it only with DEVELOPMENT_TEAM, and build with -allowProvisioningUpdates (or from
// Xcode with your Apple ID added under Settings → Accounts). A build without a team must leave it unset.
// Release builds already set both for the maintainer's team (in Config/Release.xcconfig): set your own
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM, or clear both (`DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =` and `CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS =`) to build Release
// without a team.
// CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = PullBull/PullBull.entitlements
